+            If split_heads is True:
+            - Split the query and key tensors for each head.
+            - Compute attention scores by matrix multiplication.
+            - Apply softmax to obtain attention weights.
+            - Optionally apply dropout.
+            - Split the value tensor for each head.
+            - Compute the output by multiplying attention scores with values.
+            """
+            # Split query and key for each head
+            query_heads = [query[:, :, :, i * E: (i + 1) * E] for i in range(batch_size * num_heads)]
+            key_heads = [key[i:i + 1] for i in range(key.shape[0])]
+
+            # Compute attention scores and apply softmax
+            attn_scores = [torch.matmul(query_heads[i], key_heads[i]) for i in range(len(query_heads))]
