+            If split_heads is False:
+            - Compute attention scores by matrix multiplication.
+            - Apply softmax to obtain attention weights.
+            - Optionally apply dropout.
+            - Compute the output by multiplying attention scores with values.
+            """
+            # Compute attention scores and apply softmax
